","text":"<p>You’ll receive a gift card equal to the price difference, redeemable on our official website.<br\/><\/p>","read_number":0}},"question_yXQwCg":{"type":"question","settings":{"icon":"question_mark","heading":"Are promo code purchases eligible for price match?","text":"<p>No. Orders placed using special promo codes or exclusive discounts are not eligible.<br\/><\/p>","read_number":0}},"question_wb9gPz":{"type":"question","settings":{"icon":"question_mark","heading":"How long does it take to process a price match?","text":"<p>It typically takes 2–3 business days once your request is approved.<\/p>","read_number":0}},"question_wq3xwg":{"type":"question","settings":{"icon":"question_mark","heading":"Can I price match against unauthorized sellers or third-party listings?","text":"<p>No. Only purchases from authorized Monument Grills stores are eligible.<\/p>","read_number":0}}},"block_order":["question_jin4F9","question_aMLPMU","question_4YaQfT","question_m7RP3F","question_9bUi4D","question_Y3JkVA","question_37JpE7","question_yXQwCg","question_wb9gPz","question_wq3xwg"],"settings":{"heading":"Frequently Asked Questions","heading_align":"text-center","color_scheme":"none","full_width":true}}},"order":["main","use_image_banner_Lb8NdX","rich_text_z9mWGD","media_with_text_rLgUrm","faq_JhycNY"]}